er-references","name":"laura","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:23+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"O funcionamento da Robô Laura exige a análise de um grande volume de dados e o monitoramento contínuo dos pacientes. A solução usa inteligência artificial para ajudar as equipes médicas a identificar problemas em pacientes internados antes que eles se tornem irreversíveis.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/Laura_LOGO_1.c98e953f0956e3238882cfe3c7bcb2f131b36360.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Saúde","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/laura/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","customer-name":"Laura","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Com análise de dados avançada e inteligência artificial, robô Laura salva doze vidas por dia"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2-auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","description":"Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL